# POC Bilingual Design References

When creating or editing any POC in `xingai-enterprise-ai-pocs`, every POC must link back to the matching design material in `xingai-enterprise-ai-design`.

## Required

- Each POC `README.md` must include a `Related Design Docs` section.
- Each POC `references.md` must include a `XingAI Design Docs` section.
- Design doc links must include both versions when available:
  - English article/design doc
  - 中文 article/design doc
- If the matching 中文 doc does not exist yet, add a clear `TODO: add Chinese design doc` note instead of silently linking only English.
- The design repo may link back to the runnable POC once the POC has meaningful code or architecture notes.

## Example

```md
## Related Design Docs

- EN: [From AI Demos to Enterprise AI Decision Systems](https://github.com/xingaiapp/xingai-enterprise-ai-design/blob/main/articles/2026-06-07-enterprise-ai-decision-systems.md)
- 中文: [从 AI 演示到企业 AI 决策系统](https://github.com/xingaiapp/xingai-enterprise-ai-design/blob/main/articles/2026-06-07-enterprise-ai-decision-systems.zh.md)
```
